[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3238222352","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102763#issuecomment-3238222352","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102763","id":3238222352,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BA1oQ","user":{"login":"voidiii","id":41127515,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMTI3NTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41127515?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidiii","html_url":"https://github.com/voidiii","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidiii/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidiii/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidiii/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidiii/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidiii/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidiii/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidiii/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidiii/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidiii/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-29T20:40:53Z","updated_at":"2025-08-29T20:45:22Z","body":"The bug is in this line of the code:\n`PhysicsServer3D::MotionParameters parameters(get_global_transform(), current_platform_velocity * delta, margin);` \nin function `bool CharacterBody3D::move_and_slide()` in file character_body_3d.cpp\n\nMultiplying current_platform_velocity by delta will give us an incorrect position in rotation. It is essentially a forward-Euler (Riemann–sum) step of the kinematics, which will lead to an increasing radius, hence the sliding off. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3238222352/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]